I</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ASAI, SATOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HAYASHI, TORAO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MASHIMA, SHIGERU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAKAGUCHI, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A luminance improver for phosphorescent substances which comprises at least one of a fluorescent pigment having a fluorescence peak at a wavelength in the range of 300 to 480 nm, benzotriazole, and a benzophenone compound; a high-luminance phosphorescent composition comprising the luminance improver and a phosphorescent substance; and a high-luminance phosphorescent composition comprising the composition and a transparent resin. Thus, the luminance of a phosphorescent substance can be heightened without increasing the amount thereof.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un améliorant pour substances phosphorescentes qui comprend l'un au moins des éléments suivants:'un pigment fluorescent dont la crête de fluorescence se situe entre 300 et 480 nm, du benzotriazole et un composé benzophénoné. L'invention concerne également une composition phosphorescente de luminance élevée comprenant l'améliorant de luminance et une substance phosphorescente. L'invention concerne enfin une composition phosphorescente de luminance élevée et une résine transparente. Il est ainsi possible de renforcer la luminence d'une substance phosphorescente sans en augmenter la quantité.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and it